atJFLPkAfBIQ7kNvwF_cWC9&_nc_oc=AdpJzdqqhki_cUk_p-VPOLXnlD8q1_Qfa3GQWjeJlXLOg-A5bFK6TCZXCoiTSjpPHp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFandqS3hW1u_miY9P-R2gBbZB8CUdKls8fEHqLb5_3Zw&oe=6A900DF7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tztxTGXcH2MQ7kNvwFCvWPA&_nc_oc=AdrLZpD-By7InI2KWX9zdqFAoIlOMyq8own-BH22uYXdLsFaF4Zsn_Pn833IttbtjIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEwrnqFjfiAVXfGptwfDodU3aQc01gf542KjLVpIyVVSg&oe=6A900F8A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e5diDPkQYPIQ7kNvwFKCcBf&_nc_oc=AdrO84CeYB9j6Ex64Q6Xr0XAfpx7b5RhMWthCAV9dy2tJHsekVe1442xiw53sq05wXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFnisGoSVQfYu2OGuJNSJR9ifb1MbOyuLC1yWOPn2Tv_w&oe=6A9034EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ak7wBBmUmcQ7kNvwG98Vcm&_nc_oc=Adpoeczog8K56JYvpJ8x2ZjnjV0kMgPUMGYxNTJ9Q0CHjYV-RtB5Ea7k0AI_Pg1aT5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGY7XP3UPSKqaqX-nZsq5Sdii2Y3DbiwAdZhcDVgBYzuA&oe=6A901E43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XakWKeiximAQ7kNvwGV_dGz&_nc_oc=Adr5qpyrpVHWUJUAZ1ue93jjEwIsr4_IujJXDXDh3xnYVcaI_RZlM2UKZ-wUl7ybLqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEiyjwDX39R-ERdZ77qyFEmcnwJXAxTOEnWcrLcPuhL8w&oe=6A901698"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4wywyjpgvBIQ7kNvwFJFoAz&_nc_oc=AdqcsI4K3bPRG_7K8sCGdcIzTUythzYg5l0a4o_8zAavNKDtYyadyelBXtYhkTxNnv0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHrOg9DCPnDd8tt2Gfv9Dmlo_L4FP6BCTPQmwVK81MAdw&oe=6A9029BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080